<title>BELGIUM: EU sets sugar refunds for chemical industry.</title>
<headline>EU sets sugar refunds for chemical industry.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union sugar management committee set the three monthly production refunds for chemical industry industrial products at 36.615 ecus per 100 kg with effect from April 1, a Commission official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The refund was set a week early because there is no meeting of the sugar management committee next week,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
